== Walkthrough ==

You say, 'Hail, Horgus'

: Horgus says, 'What!!? You [Craknek] or you [pest]?'

You say, 'i craknek'

: Horgus says, 'Good. Me not bash you.  You help Horgus and Crakneks.  Go smash lizards.  Bring four tails.  Greenbloods think they get all lizard tails.  We take first.  Taste good.  You bring four tails.  Me give you tings.  Me gives armur.  Now go!!'

[[Lizard Tail|Lizard Tails]] drop from any lizardman in [[The Feerrott]], [[Rathe Mountains]], or [[Cazic Thule (Zone)|Cazic Thule]]. Hand 4 of them (or a stack of any multiple of 4) to Horgus.

: Horgus says, 'Bwahaha! Dumb Greenbloods no have lizard tails now. We make good stew with tails. Mmmm. What?! Oh. Me forgot reward. Take this. Coin and armur. Go keep killing lizards.'

